     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\">Hello Distance team,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\">I wanted to export/save the prediction map generated by DSM (see the ggplot attachment) as a GIS layer (e.g. grid, tiff etc.) so that I can visualize and do map layouts  in arcGIS/ArcMap software.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\">Is there a way to do it?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\">Best regards</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:#073763\">Richard</div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#385723\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Richard\r\nA. Giliba</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">School\r\nof Life Sciences and Bio-Engineering </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:7pt\">The\r\nNelson Mandela African Institution of Science and Technology, Arusha, </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">P.O. Box\r\n447 Arusha, Tanzania.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Cell:\r\n<a href=\"tel:+255%20767%20710%20622\" value=\"+255767710622\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+255 767 710 622</a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#073763\">Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:blue\">richard...@nm-aist.ac.tz</span></a> </span></p><u><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue\"><span style=\"color:blue\"></span></span></u></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u><span style=\"font-size:7pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:blue;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=Smn5kqsAAAAJ&amp;view_op=list_works&amp;sortby=pubdate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl%3Den%26user%3DSmn5kqsAAAAJ%26view_op%3Dlist_works%26sortby%3Dpubdate&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472509600000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZrSR7scOhQ8zESYVvzm4y\">https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=Smn5kqsAAAAJ&amp;view_op=list_works&amp;sortby=pubdate</a></span></u></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"></span></p></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
